OL,3,GNEWSABusinesses respond as town centre
OL,4,Aworks cancelled
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil leader Tim Oliver, who
OL,7,Frepresents the Weybridge division, said
OL,8,Fthe authority had "always tried to
OL,9,Ffocus on the longer-term benefits" to
OL,10,Fthe town and he was "disappointed the
OL,11,Fimprovement works will no longer
OL,12,Fproceed".
